00:03:58.719 --> 00:04:03.290
at Day9's channel, I've put a link to a relevant
series in the video description.

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.570
Highly recommended.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:08.920
So there you go, a fresh Two Minute Papers
